p><p style=3D"font:normal 17px/25px georgia,serif;color:#333;margin:0 0 15p=
x"><span>There=E2=80=99s this whole conversation in the international diplo=
matic community: How do you deal with Trump=3F I=E2=80=99ve always thought =
that conversation is sort of absurd. The Europeans talk about this playbook=
 =E2=80=94 you flatter him, bring him gifts and what have you. That might g=
et you something, for a day or two. But what Xi Jinping showed is the way t=
o deal with Trump is through strength.</span></p><p style=3D"font:normal 17=
px/25px georgia,serif;color:#333;margin:0 0 15px"><span>Trump really unders=
